idioms.lus:4:1: hint: use 'from' destructuring: local ... from config [use-from]
idioms.lus:10:1: hint: nested nil checks can use optional chaining: x?.y?.z [use-optional-chain]
idioms.lus:16:13: hint: and-chain can use optional chaining: x?.y?.z [use-optional-chain]
idioms.lus:19:1: hint: local declaration can be moved to the if condition (use if-assignment) [use-if-assign]
idioms.lus:37:1: warning: pledge() after pledge("seal") has no effect, permissions are frozen [pledge-after-seal]
